"基于 macOS 原生 WebKit 构建的多环境隔离浏览器\n\n%@" = "An isolated multi-profile browser built on macOS WebKit.\n\n%@";
"基于系统 WebKit 原生能力实现，不向网页注入任何篡改脚本。高级隐私保护、Safari 专有接口与字体、按语言收窄字体已默认开启；配置代理或节点时默认一并关闭 WebRTC，防止 STUN 泄露真实 IP。" = "Implemented with native WebKit capabilities; no spoofing scripts are injected into pages. Advanced Privacy Protection, Safari-specific APIs and fonts, and language-based font narrowing are on by default; WebRTC is turned off by default when a proxy or node is configured to prevent STUN from leaking your real IP.";
"填写一个出站对象，不是完整配置。可包含认证信息；复制或分享前请移除密码。" = "Enter a single outbound object, not a full configuration. It can include credentials; remove the password before copying or sharing.";
"填订阅网址（内容可以是 Base64 或逐行的节点链接），或者直接粘贴一条或多条节点链接：ss:// ss2022:// vless:// vmess:// trojan:// anytls:// socks://。添加时会立即解析一次节点；直接粘贴的链接保存在本机，hysteria2 等暂不支持的协议会跳过。" = "Enter a subscription URL (Base64 or one node link per line), or paste one or more node links: ss:// ss2022:// vless:// vmess:// trojan:// anytls:// socks://. Nodes are parsed once when you add it. Pasted links are stored locally; unsupported protocols such as hysteria2 are skipped.";
"填订阅网址（内容可以是 Base64、逐行节点链接或 Hysteria2 Clash YAML），或者直接粘贴一条或多条节点链接：ss:// ss2022:// vless:// vmess:// trojan:// anytls:// socks://。添加时会立即解析一次节点；直接粘贴的链接保存在本机，TUIC 等暂不支持的协议会跳过；Hysteria2 请使用 Clash YAML 订阅。" = "Enter a subscription URL (Base64, one node link per line, or Hysteria2 Clash YAML), or paste one or more node links: ss:// ss2022:// vless:// vmess:// trojan:// anytls:// socks://. Nodes are parsed once when added. Pasted links are stored locally; unsupported protocols such as TUIC are skipped; use Clash YAML for Hysteria2.";
