"用法：\n  safarier profile list\n  safarier profile create --name NAME [--mode persistent|ephemeral] [--lang proxy|system|en-US,en] [--tz proxy|system|America/Los_Angeles] [--url https://example.com] [--proxy PROXY_ID | --sub SUBSCRIPTION_ID --node NODE_NAME] [--device MODEL] [--notes TEXT] [--spi default|none|all|afp,tz,webrtc,safari,webgpu,fontlist]\n  safarier profile update PROFILE_ID [--name NAME] [--lang proxy|system|en-US,en] [--tz proxy|system|ZONE] [--url URL|none] [--proxy PROXY_ID|none | --sub SUBSCRIPTION_ID --node NODE_NAME | --node none] [--device MODEL|none] [--notes TEXT] [--spi default|none|all|afp,tz,webrtc,safari,webgpu,fontlist]\n  safarier profile clone PROFILE_ID [--name NAME]\n  safarier profile delete PROFILE_ID [--purge-data]\n  safarier proxy list\n  safarier proxy add --name NAME --kind socks5|httpConnect --host HOST --port PORT [--username USER] [--password-stdin] [--upstream-proxy ID | --upstream-sub ID --upstream-node NAME | --upstream-json-file PATH]\n  safarier proxy update PROXY_ID [--upstream-proxy ID|none | --upstream-sub ID --upstream-node NAME | --upstream-json-file PATH]\n  safarier proxy delete PROXY_ID\n  safarier sub add --name NAME --url URL|节点链接|-\n  safarier sub list\n  safarier sub update [SUBSCRIPTION_ID]\n  safarier sub nodes SUBSCRIPTION_ID\n  safarier device list\n  safarier ext list\n  safarier ext add PATH [--profile PROFILE_ID]\n  safarier ext remove NAME\n  safarier launch PROFILE_ID [--url URL] [--spi LIST] [--background]\n  safarier probe PROFILE_ID [--url URL] [--spi LIST]\n  safarier agent skill | install-skill | spaces\n  safarier agent open PROFILE_ID_OR_NAME [URL] [--background] [--new-tab]\n  safarier agent snapshot PROFILE_ID_OR_NAME [--tab N]\n  safarier agent click PROFILE_ID_OR_NAME REF_OR_SELECTOR [--tab N]\n  safarier agent fill PROFILE_ID_OR_NAME REF_OR_SELECTOR TEXT [--tab N]\n  safarier agent type PROFILE_ID_OR_NAME REF_OR_SELECTOR TEXT [--delay-ms 30] [--tab N]\n  safarier agent click-xy PROFILE_ID_OR_NAME X Y [--hold-ms MS] [--tab N]\n  safarier agent wait PROFILE_ID_OR_NAME SELECTOR_OR_TEXT [--timeout-ms 10000] [--tab N]\n  safarier agent focus PROFILE_ID_OR_NAME [--tab N]\n  safarier agent eval PROFILE_ID_OR_NAME JS_CODE [--tab N]\n  safarier agent screenshot PROFILE_ID_OR_NAME OUTPUT_PATH [--tab N]\n  safarier agent tab-list | tab-new | tab-close PROFILE_ID_OR_NAME [--tab N]\n--sub/--node：出站走订阅里的节点（按节点名匹配，名字带空格时加引号）；启动时自动起 sing-box 转成本地 SOCKS5。\n       和 --proxy 二选一：设了一个就清掉另一个。\n--lang/--tz：proxy（或 auto）= 跟随代理，每次启动按代理出口 IP 的国家自动设置；system（或 none）= 跟随系统；\n       其它值是语言标签（逗号分隔）或时区标识。\n--device：模拟机型（见 device list），决定浏览窗口的默认视口尺寸、比例和屏幕色域 / HDR。\n--spi：系统 WebKit 原生隐私能力。afp=高级隐私保护（反指纹），tz=引擎层时区同步，webrtc=关闭 WebRTC，\n       safari=打开 Safari 专有接口（ApplePaySession、PushManager、navigator.mediaDevices），并像 Safari 一样关闭用户安装字体，\n       webgpu=打开 WebGPU（真 Safari 在 macOS 15 上没有，打开后和真 Safari 不一致），\n       fontlist=保留系统卷基础字体（含冬青黑体、宋体），按 Profile 语言排除额外下载的字体资产（如英文环境隐藏苹方）。\n       新建环境默认 default（afp,tz,safari,fontlist）；all 是全部六项。launch/probe 上的 --spi 只覆盖这一次运行。\nsub add --url：订阅网址（http / https / file），或直接给节点链接（ss:// ss2022:// vless:// vmess:// trojan:// anytls:// socks://，\n       多条用换行分隔，也可以是 Base64；- 表示从标准输入读）。直接给的链接保存在元数据目录的 subscriptions-inline/ 里，\n       sub update 时重新读它。订阅里 hysteria2 等暂不支持的协议会跳过，其余节点照常导入。\nprofile clone：复制全部设置到新环境（新 ID，不复制 Cookie 等网站数据），默认名字加「副本」。\n前置连接：本机 → 前置代理/节点 → 当前代理 → 网站。仅支持两跳；--upstream-proxy none 清除前置。\n       自定义前置从文件读取单个 sing-box 出站 JSON，避免认证信息出现在命令行参数中。\n环境变量 SAFARIER_HOME 可覆盖元数据目录（默认 ~/Library/Application Support/Safarier）。" = "Usage:\n  safarier profile list\n  safarier profile create --name NAME [--mode persistent|ephemeral] [--lang proxy|system|en-US,en] [--tz proxy|system|America/Los_Angeles] [--url https://example.com] [--proxy PROXY_ID | --sub SUBSCRIPTION_ID --node NODE_NAME] [--device MODEL] [--notes TEXT] [--spi default|none|all|afp,tz,webrtc,safari,webgpu,fontlist]\n  safarier profile update PROFILE_ID [--name NAME] [--lang proxy|system|en-US,en] [--tz proxy|system|ZONE] [--url URL|none] [--proxy PROXY_ID|none | --sub SUBSCRIPTION_ID --node NODE_NAME | --node none] [--device MODEL|none] [--notes TEXT] [--spi default|none|all|afp,tz,webrtc,safari,webgpu,fontlist]\n  safarier profile clone PROFILE_ID [--name NAME]\n  safarier profile delete PROFILE_ID [--purge-data]\n  safarier proxy list\n  safarier proxy add --name NAME --kind socks5|httpConnect --host HOST --port PORT [--username USER] [--password-stdin] [--upstream-proxy ID | --upstream-sub ID --upstream-node NAME | --upstream-json-file PATH]\n  safarier proxy update PROXY_ID [--upstream-proxy ID|none | --upstream-sub ID --upstream-node NAME | --upstream-json-file PATH]\n  safarier proxy delete PROXY_ID\n  safarier sub add --name NAME --url URL|NODE_LINK|-\n  safarier sub list\n  safarier sub update [SUBSCRIPTION_ID]\n  safarier sub nodes SUBSCRIPTION_ID\n  safarier device list\n  safarier ext list\n  safarier ext add PATH [--profile PROFILE_ID]\n  safarier ext remove NAME\n  safarier launch PROFILE_ID [--url URL] [--spi LIST] [--background]\n  safarier probe PROFILE_ID [--url URL] [--spi LIST]\n  safarier agent skill | install-skill | spaces\n  safarier agent open PROFILE_ID_OR_NAME [URL] [--background] [--new-tab]\n  safarier agent snapshot PROFILE_ID_OR_NAME [--tab N]\n  safarier agent click PROFILE_ID_OR_NAME REF_OR_SELECTOR [--tab N]\n  safarier agent fill PROFILE_ID_OR_NAME REF_OR_SELECTOR TEXT [--tab N]\n  safarier agent type PROFILE_ID_OR_NAME REF_OR_SELECTOR TEXT [--delay-ms 30] [--tab N]\n  safarier agent click-xy PROFILE_ID_OR_NAME X Y [--hold-ms MS] [--tab N]\n  safarier agent wait PROFILE_ID_OR_NAME SELECTOR_OR_TEXT [--timeout-ms 10000] [--tab N]\n  safarier agent focus PROFILE_ID_OR_NAME [--tab N]\n  safarier agent eval PROFILE_ID_OR_NAME JS_CODE [--tab N]\n  safarier agent screenshot PROFILE_ID_OR_NAME OUTPUT_PATH [--tab N]\n  safarier agent tab-list | tab-new | tab-close PROFILE_ID_OR_NAME [--tab N]\n--sub/--node: outbound goes through a node in the subscription (matched by node name; quote names that contain spaces); sing-box is started automatically at launch and exposed as a local SOCKS5 proxy.\n       Mutually exclusive with --proxy: setting one clears the other.\n--lang/--tz: proxy (or auto) = follow the proxy, set on every launch from the country of the proxy exit IP; system (or none) = follow the system;\n       any other value is a comma-separated list of language tags or a time zone identifier.\n--device: simulated device model (see device list); sets the browser window's default viewport size, scale, and color gamut / HDR.\n--spi: native WebKit privacy features. afp=Advanced Privacy Protection (anti-fingerprinting), tz=engine-level time zone sync, webrtc=disable WebRTC,\n       safari=enable Safari-only interfaces (ApplePaySession, PushManager, navigator.mediaDevices) and disable user-installed fonts like Safari,\n       webgpu=enable WebGPU (real Safari on macOS 15 does not have it, so enabling it diverges from Safari),\n       fontlist=keep the system volume's base fonts (including Hiragino Sans and Songti) and exclude downloaded font assets that do not match the profile language (e.g. hide PingFang in an English profile).\n       New profiles default to default (afp,tz,safari,fontlist); all means all six. --spi on launch/probe overrides just this run.\nsub add --url: subscription URL (http / https / file), or inline node links (ss:// ss2022:// vless:// vmess:// trojan:// anytls:// socks://,\n       multiple links separated by newlines; Base64 also accepted; - reads from standard input). Inline links are stored in subscriptions-inline/\n       in the metadata directory and re-read on sub update. Protocols a subscription does not support yet (e.g. hysteria2) are skipped; other nodes import as usual.\nprofile clone: copy all settings into a new profile (new ID; site data such as cookies is not copied); the default name gets a “copy” suffix.\nupstream: this Mac → upstream proxy/node → this proxy → website. Two hops only; --upstream-proxy none clears the upstream.\n       A custom upstream is read from a file containing one sing-box outbound JSON object, so credentials never appear in command-line arguments.\nThe SAFARIER_HOME environment variable overrides the metadata directory (default ~/Library/Application Support/Safarier).";
