"视口尺寸和纵横比、devicePixelRatio、显示器分辨率与可用区域、P3 色域和 HDR（网页的 color-gamut / dynamic-range 媒体查询）按机型设置，宿主机屏幕放不下时初始窗口等比缩小。高级隐私保护和机型互不影响：开启时网页的 screen 和 outer 尺寸随视口收敛，和真 Safari 无痕窗口一样；关闭时网页的 screen 报目标机型显示器的分辨率（台式机按搭配的显示器算），可用高度扣掉菜单栏。CPU 核数和 GPU 名称按真 Safari 的规则给：WebKit 只报 4 或 8 核、GPU 一律写「Apple GPU」，所以这几款机型在真 Safari 里都是 8 核 · Apple GPU，写成芯片规格反而露馅。" = "Viewport size and aspect ratio, devicePixelRatio, display resolution and available area, P3 gamut and HDR (the page's color-gamut / dynamic-range media queries) follow the device model; the initial window scales down proportionally when it does not fit the host screen. Advanced Privacy Protection and device model are independent: when it is on, the page's screen and outer sizes shrink to the viewport, exactly like a real Safari private window; when it is off, the page's screen reports the target model's display resolution (for desktops, the paired display), with the menu bar subtracted from the available height. CPU core count and GPU name follow real Safari's rules: WebKit only ever reports 4 or 8 cores and always spells the GPU as “Apple GPU”, so all of these models appear as 8-core · Apple GPU in real Safari — reporting the chip's actual specs would give it away.";
